#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""CS&P RAG -- Hybrid RAG Offline Updater (v015, 20260821, 352 tests)

Standalone, self-extracting, non-interactive Windows deployment payload for the
CS&P RAG Local Search application. Upgrades any existing `company-knowledge-search`
installation to the v015 release. Supersedes prior updates.

Changes in v015 (Windows Validation Candidate):
  * CONVERSATION SCROLL: Single-page document scrolling; conversation turns no
    longer create nested vertical scroll contexts.
  * CITATIONS: Natural-height grid source rows with compact secondary 開啟
    actions and no vertical clipping.
  * CHAT HIERARCHY: Removed standalone user label and fragile raw assistant
    wrapper; user bubble remains the user-role signal.
  * USER STATE PRESERVATION: data/conversations.json, knowledge.db, documents/,
    config.json, .env, .venv, models/, logs/, backups/ preserved 100%.
"""

